cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Brutus-Pell L8 Exact-Rank Relation and an Explicit q=47 Witness"
type: preprint
authors:
  - family-names: "Saint-Pierre"
    given-names: "Gabriel"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-10-01"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Topbrutus/Brutus-Pell-L8"
keywords:
  - Pell sequence
  - Lucas sequence
  - rank of appearance
  - exact rank
  - computational number theory
  - ECM factorization
abstract: >-
  This work records the Brutus-Pell L8 exact-rank relation for the Pell sequence
  and an explicit q=47 computational witness. A 36-digit prime factor of Q_47
  is verified to have exact Pell entry rank 2209 = 47^2.
